  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM global supply hub in Greece &#x2013; operational processes and technical compliance requirements</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As humanitarian crises continue to increase in scale, complexity, and frequency, the ability to deliver life-saving relief items rapidly and efficiently is more critical than ever. The Supply Chain Management Centre (SCMC) serves as both a regional and global hub for IOM&apos;s procurement, warehousing, and logistics operations, providing the infrastructure, technical expertise, and prepositioned stocks required to support timely and effective humanitarian responses.Through this project, IOM is supporting the establishment of the warehouse and strengthening the logistics capacity of the Supply Chain Management Centre (SCMC) in Thessaloniki, Greece as one of the hubs for stock prepositioning for quicker and efficient responses to humanitarian crisis globally.</narrative>
  </description>
